WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:06.900
Bank and accounts is where Systems connects to the tools you already use.

2
00:00:07.150 --> 00:00:13.701
Connect Xero, QuickBooks or FreeAgent, and the invoices you approve land there as drafts.

3
00:00:13.951 --> 00:00:20.902
To match payments, drop in a CSV statement from your bank. There's no bank login.

4
00:00:21.152 --> 00:00:27.302
Payments in are matched to your unpaid invoices.

